2026-07-27T08:20:42.4689150Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:20:42.4689898Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:20:42.4690430Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:20:42.4690989Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:20:42.4691403Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
